":"準備とは、Junjo AI Studio タスクのためにコアドキュメントと設定を確認することです","ko":"준비는 준조 AI 스튜디오 작업을 위한 핵심 문서 및 설정을 확인하는 것을 의미합니다","es":"La preparación es el proceso de configurar y revisar los documentos y la infraestructura necesarios para el desarrollo de proyectos de AI","fr":"La préparation est le processus de configuration et de révision des documents et de l''infrastructure nécessaires pour le développement de projets d''IA","de":"Die Vorbereitung ist der Prozess der Konfiguration und Überprüfung der erforderlichen Dokumente und Infrastruktur für die Entwicklung von KI-Projekten","pt":"Preparar é o processo de configuração do ambiente de desenvolvimento para AI Agents, incluindo revisão de documentos e configuração de serviços","ru":"Подготовка - это процесс настройки среды разработки для ИИ Агентов, включая обзор документов и настройку сервисов","ar":"الإعداد هو عملية تكوين بيئة التطوير لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي، بما في ذلك مراجعة الوثائق وتكوين الخدمات"},"features":{"en":["Reviews core documents such as README.md and AGENTS.md","Supports setup of Docker using docker-compose.yml and service Dockerfiles","Includes review of global and ingestion ADR docs in docs/adr/** and ingestion/adr/**","Enables review of detailed docs such as TESTING.md and backend/app/db_sqlite/README.md","Facilitates setup of SQLite and Alembic patterns with autouse fixtures","Streamlines review of ingestion/Docker setup"],"zh":["审查 README.md 和 AGENTS.md","配置 Docker-compose 文件","审查测试文档，包括 TESTING.md","使用 SQLite 和 Alembic 模式","审查 ingestion ADR 文档"],"ja":["README.md と AGENTS.md の確認","Docker-compose ファイルの設定","TESTING.md を含むテストドキュメントの確認","SQLite と Alembic パターンの使用","ingestion ADR ドキュメントの確認"],"ko":["README.md 및 AGENTS.md 확인","Docker-compose 파일 설정","TESTING.md를 포함한 테스트 문서 확인","SQLite 및 Alembic 패턴 사용","ingestion ADR 문서 확인"],"es":["Revisión de documentos clave como README.md y AGENTS.md","Configuración de Docker y revisión de docker-compose.yml","Revisión de la arquitectura y el diseño de la ingesta de datos","Configuración de la base de datos SQLite y Alembic","Revisión de los patrones de prueba y la integración con MSW"],"fr":["Révision des documents clés tels que README.md et AGENTS.md","Configuration de Docker et révision de docker-compose.yml","Révision de l''architecture et de la conception de l''ingestion de données","Configuration de la base de données SQLite et Alembic","Révision des modèles de test et de l''intégration avec MSW"],"de":["Überprüfung wichtiger Dokumente wie README.md und AGENTS.md","Konfiguration von Docker und Überprüfung von docker-compose.yml","Überprüfung der Architektur und des Designs der Datenübernahme","Konfiguration der SQLite-Datenbank und Alembic","Überprüfung der Testmuster und der Integration mit MSW"],"pt":["Revisão de documentos como README.md e AGENTS.md","Configuração de serviços com docker-compose.yml","Utilização de SQLite e Alembic para gerenciamento de banco de dados","Integração com MSW para testes","Utilização de fixtures para testes","Suporte a multiple serviços com ingestion/Docker"],"ru":["Просмотр документов, таких как README.md и AGENTS.md","Настройка сервисов с docker-compose.yml","Использование SQLite и Alembic для управления базой данных","Интеграция с MSW для тестов","Использование фикстур для тестов","Поддержка нескольких сервисов с ingestion/Docker"],"ar":["مراجعة الوثائق مثل README.md و AGENTS.md","تكوين الخدمات مع docker-compose.yml","استخدام SQLite و Alembic لإدارة قاعدة البيانات","التكامل مع MSW للاختبارات","استخدام الإعدادات للاختبارات","دعم خدمات متعددة مع ingestion/Docker"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use prepare","what is prepare","prepare setup guide","prepare install","prepare alternative","prepare vs docker","junjo ai studio task setup","ai agent skill prepare","docker compose setup","ingestion adr docs"],"zh":["Junjo AI Studio","AI 工具","AIエージェント","Docker-compose","README.md","AGENTS.md","SQLite","Alembic"],"ja":["Junjo AI Studio","AI エージェント","AI ツール","Docker-compose","README.md","AGENTS.md","SQLite","Alembic"],"ko":["준조 AI 스튜디오","AI 에이전트","AI 도구","Docker-compose","README.md","AGENTS.md","SQLite","Alembic"],"es":["herramientas de AI","configuración de Docker","revisión de documentos","desarrollo de proyectos de AI","integración con MSW","base de datos SQLite","Alembic","pruebas de software"],"fr":["outils d''IA","configuration de Docker","révision de documents","développement de projets d''IA","intégration avec MSW","base de données SQLite","Alembic","tests de logiciel"],"de":["KI-Tools","Konfiguration von Docker","Überprüfung von Dokumenten","Entwicklung von KI-Projekten","Integration mit MSW","SQLite-Datenbank","Alembic","Software-Tests"],"pt":["AI Agents","Desenvolvimento de AI","Configuração de ambiente","Revisão de documentos","Configuração de serviços","Docker","SQLite","Alembic","MSW","Fixtures"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","Разработка ИИ","Настройка среды","Обзор документов","Настройка сервисов","Docker","SQLite","Alembic","MSW","Фикстуры"],"ar":["عميل الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكوين البيئة","مراجعة الوثائق","تكوين الخدمات","Docker","SQLite","Alembic","MSW","الإعدادات"]}},"owner":"mdrideout","repo":"junjo-ai-studio","repoPath":"mdrideout/junjo-ai-studio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.378Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prepare","description":"Prepare to work in the Junjo AI Studio repo by reviewing core docs (README, AGENTS, ADRs, testing/db docs, docker-compose/Dockerfiles, GitHub workflows) and then confirming readiness with a brief explanation of the system data flow. Use when starting a new task in this codebase, onboarding, or when asked to “prepare”, “review conventions/architecture”, or “understand how the system works” before making changes.","bodyPreview":"# Prepare for a Junjo AI Studio task\n\n## Review core documents\n\n1. Review `README.md`.\n2. Review `AGENTS.md` (architecture overview).\n3. Review global ADR docs in `docs/adr/**`.\n4. Review ingestion ADR docs in `ingestion/adr/**`.\n5. Review detailed docs as needed:\n   - `TESTING.md` (contract tests, MSW integration tests, fixtures)\n   - `backend/app/db_sqlite/README.md` (SQLite + Alembic patterns, autouse fixtures)\n6. Review `docker-compose.yml` and each service Dockerfile:\n   - `ingestion/Docker","body":"# Prepare for a Junjo AI Studio task\n\n## Review core documents\n\n1. Review `README.md`.\n2. Review `AGENTS.md` (architecture overview).\n3. Review global ADR docs in `docs/adr/**`.\n4. Review ingestion ADR docs in `ingestion/adr/**`.\n5. Review detailed docs as needed:\n   - `TESTING.md` (contract tests, MSW integration tests, fixtures)\n   - `backend/app/db_sqlite/README.md` (SQLite + Alembic patterns, autouse fixtures)\n6. Review `docker-compose.yml` and each service Dockerfile:\n   - `ingestion/Dockerfile`\n   - `frontend/Dockerfile`\n   - `backend/Dockerfile`\n7. Skim `.github/workflows/**` to understand CI expectations (tests, proto staleness, gitleaks).\n\n## Notes\n\n- Do not include simulated secrets (example API keys, tokens, or credentials) in any output, including plans and comments (avoid triggering gitleaks). \n\n## Confirm readiness\n\n- State that you are ready to proceed.\n- Give a very short (1–3 sentence) explanation of the end-to-end data flow and functionality.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:05:25.946Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring thorough project setup and documentation review for Junjo AI Studio tasks","zh":"适合需要对项目设置和文档审查进行彻底处理的开发代理，特别是用于Junjo AI Studio任务","ja":"Junjo AI Studioタスクのためのプロジェクト設定とドキュメントレビューを徹底的に行う必要がある開発エージェントに適しています","ko":"프로젝트 설정과 문서 검토를 철저하게 처리해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히 Junjo AI Studio 작업을 위한 경우에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren una configuración de proyecto y revisión de documentación exhaustiva para tareas de Junjo AI Studio","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une configuration de projet et une révision de documentation approfondie pour les tâches de Junjo AI Studio","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine gründliche Projektsetup und Dokumentenprüfung für Junjo AI Studio Aufgaben benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem configuração de projeto e revisão de documentação abrangente para tarefas do Junjo AI Studio","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих тщательной настройки проекта и проверки документации для задач Junjo AI Studio","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيين الذين يتطلبون إعداد مشروع شامل ومراجعة الوثائق لمهام استوديو Junjo AI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master ingestion ADR docs, review core documents such as README.md and AGENTS.md, and setup Docker environments with docker-compose.yml and service Dockerfiles, streamlining project initialization with protocols like Alembic and SQLite","zh":"赋予代理掌握摄取ADR文档的能力，审查核心文档如README.md和AGENTS.md，并使用docker-compose.yml和服务Dockerfiles设置Docker环境，从而通过Alembic和SQLite等协议简化项目初始化","ja":"エージェントがADRドキュメントの取り込みをマスターし、README.mdやAGENTS.mdなどのコアドキュメントをレビューし、docker-compose.ymlとサービスDockerfilesを使用してDocker環境を設定できるようにし、AlembicやSQLiteなどのプロトコルを使用してプロジェクトの初期化をストリームライン化する","ko":"에이전트가摄取 ADR 문서를 마스터하고 README.md 및 AGENTS.md와 같은 핵심 문서를 검토하며 docker-compose.yml 및 서비스 Dockerfiles를 사용하여 Docker 환경을 설정할 수 있도록 해줌으로써 Alembic 및 SQLite와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 프로젝트 초기화를 간소화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar la ingesta de documentos ADR, revisar documentos básicos como README.md y AGENTS.md, y configurar entornos Docker con docker-compose.yml y Dockerfiles de servicio, optimizando la inicialización del proyecto con protocolos como Alembic y SQLite","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser l''ingestion de documents ADR, de réviser les documents de base tels que README.md et AGENTS.md, et de configurer des environnements Docker avec docker-compose.yml et des Dockerfiles de service, rationalisant l''initialisation du projet avec des protocoles comme Alembic et SQLite","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Verarbeitung von ADR-Dokumenten zu beherrschen, Kern-Dokumente wie README.md und AGENTS.md zu überprüfen und Docker-Umgebungen mit docker-compose.yml und Service-Dockerfiles zu konfigurieren, wodurch die Projektinitialisierung mit Protokollen wie Alembic und SQLite optimiert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar a ingestão de documentos ADR, revisar documentos principais como README.md e AGENTS.md e configurar ambientes Docker com docker-compose.yml e Dockerfiles de serviço, simplificando a inicialização do projeto com protocolos como Alembic e SQLite","ru":"Позволяет агентам овладеть ингестией документов ADR, просмотреть основные документы, такие как README.md и AGENTS.md, и настроить среды Docker с помощью docker-compose.yml и Dockerfiles службы, оптимизируя инициализацию проекта с протоколами, такими как Alembic и SQLite","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإتقانprocess الأوراق ADR، ومراجعة الوثائق الأساسية مثل README.md و AGENTS.md، وضبط بيئات Docker مع docker-compose.yml وملفات Docker خدمة، وبذلك يسرع من عملية إعداد المشروع باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Alembic و SQLite"},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing global ADR docs for project architecture overview","Setting up Docker environments for ingestion tasks","Mastering ingestion ADR docs for efficient data processing"],"zh":["审查全局ADR文档以了解项目架构概述","为摄取任务设置Docker环境","掌握摄取ADR文档以实现高效的数据处理"],"ja":["プロジェクトアーキテクチャの概要を把握するためにグローバルADRドキュメントをレビューする","取り込みタスクのためにDocker環境を設定する","効率的なデータ処理を実現するために取り込みADRドキュメントをマスターする"],"ko":["프로젝트 아키텍처 개요를 이해하기 위해 전역 ADR 문서를 검토하는 것","摄取 작업을 위한 Docker 환경 설정","효율적인 데이터 처리를 위해摄取 ADR 문서를 마스터하는 것"],"es":["Revisar documentos ADR globales para obtener una visión general de la arquitectura del proyecto","Configurar entornos Docker para tareas de ingesta","Dominar documentos ADR de ingesta para un procesamiento de datos eficiente"],"fr":["Réviser les documents ADR mondiaux pour obtenir une vue d''ensemble de l''architecture du projet","Configurer des environnements Docker pour les tâches d''ingestion","Maîtriser les documents ADR d''ingestion pour un traitement de données efficace"],"de":["Überprüfen globaler ADR-Dokumente für einen Überblick über die Projektarchitektur","Einrichten von Docker-Umgebungen für Aufgaben der Datenverarbeitung","Beherrschen von ADR-Dokumenten für die Datenverarbeitung für einen effizienten Datenverarbeitungsprozess"],"pt":["Revisão de documentos ADR globais para visão geral da arquitetura do projeto","Configuração de ambientes Docker para tarefas de ingestão","Domínio de documentos ADR de ingestão para processamento eficiente de dados"],"ru":["Просмотр глобальных документов ADR для обзора архитектуры проекта","Настройка сред Docker для задач ингестии","Овладение документами ADR ингестии для эффективной обработки данных"],"ar":["مراجعة مستندات ADR العالمية لمحة عامة عن هيكل المشروع","ضبط بيئات Docker لمهام process","إتقان مستندات ADR الخاصة process لمعالجة بيانات فعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Junjo AI Studio task documentation","Dependent on Docker and specific service Dockerfiles","Needs review of detailed documentation like TESTING.md and backend/app/db_sqlite/README.md"],"zh":["需要访问Junjo AI Studio任务文档","依赖于Docker和特定的服务Dockerfiles","需要审查详细的文档，如TESTING.md和backend/app/db_sqlite/README.md"],"ja":["Junjo AI Studioタスクのドキュメントにアクセスする必要がある","Dockerと特定のサービスDockerfilesに依存している","TESTING.mdやbackend/app/db_sqlite/README.mdなどの詳細なドキュメントをレビューする必要がある"],"ko":["Junjo AI Studio 작업 문서에 액세스해야 함","Docker 및 특정 서비스 Dockerfiles에 의존","TESTING.md 및 backend/app/db_sqlite/README.md와 같은詳細한 문서를 검토해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación de tareas de Junjo AI Studio","Dependiente de Docker y Dockerfiles de servicio específicos","Necesita revisar documentación detallada como TESTING.md y backend/app/db_sqlite/README.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation des tâches de Junjo AI Studio","Dépendant de Docker et de Dockerfiles de service spécifiques","Nécessite une révision de la documentation détaillée telle que TESTING.md et backend/app/db_sqlite/README.md"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Dokumentation von Junjo AI Studio-