INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('mdrideout/junjo-ai-studio/prepare', 'prepare', 'mdrideout', 'junjo-ai-studio', 'community', 'prepare mdrideout junjo-ai-studio community Prepare is an AI agent skill that enables developers to review core documents, setup Docker, and master ingestion ADR docs for a Junjo AI Studio task. It benefits developers working with AI agents. 准备 Junjo AI Studio 任务需要审查核心文档和配置，包括 README.md、AGENTS.md 和 Docker-compose 文件 Junjo AI Studio タスクの準備には、README.md、AGENTS.md、Docker-compose ファイルなどのコアドキュメントと設定の確認が必要です 준조 AI 스튜디오 작업을 준비하려면 README.md, AGENTS.md 및 Docker-compose 파일과 같은 핵심 문서 및 설정을 확인해야 합니다 La preparación es un paso crucial para el éxito de tus proyectos de AI. Revisa los documentos clave y configura Docker para asegurarte de que estás listo para empezar. La préparation est une étape cruciale pour le succès de vos projets d''IA. Révisez les documents clés et configurez Docker pour vous assurer que vous êtes prêt à commencer. Die Vorbereitung ist ein entscheidender Schritt für den Erfolg Ihrer KI-Projekte. Überprüfen Sie die wichtigsten Dokumente und konfigurieren Sie Docker, um sicherzustellen, dass Sie bereit sind, loszulegen. Prepare o ambiente de desenvolvimento para AI Agents, revisando documentos como README.md e AGENTS.md, e configurando serviços com docker-compose.yml Подготовьте среду разработки для ИИ Агентов, просмотрев документы, такие как README.md и AGENTS.md, и настроив сервисы с docker-compose.yml أعد بيئة التطوير لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي، من خلال مراجعة الوثائق مثل README.md و AGENTS.md، وتكوين الخدمات مع docker-compose.yml how to use prepare what is prepare prepare setup guide prepare install prepare alternative prepare vs docker junjo ai studio task setup ai agent skill prepare docker compose setup ingestion adr docs Junjo AI Studio AI 工具 AIエージェント Docker-compose README.md AGENTS.md SQLite Alembic Reviews core documents such as README.md and AGENTS.md Supports setup of Docker using docker-compose.yml and service Dockerfiles Includes review of global and ingestion ADR docs in docs/adr/** and ingestion/adr/** Enables review of detailed docs such as TESTING.md and backend/app/db_sqlite/README.md Facilitates setup of SQLite and Alembic patterns with autouse fixtures Streamlines review of ingestion/Docker setup Prepare is a skill that allows developers to review and setup necessary documents and configurations for a Junjo AI Studio task, including README.md, AGENTS.md, and Docker setup.');
