con Effect utilizando pipe/Effect.gen","Aplicar fundamentos de Effect TS a código y arquitectura de usuario","Mejorar habilidades con efectos y errores en Node, Bun y navegador"],"fr":["Clarifier le contexte d''exécution (Node, Bun, navigateur)","Séparer la logique de domaine pure des effets et des limites","Modéliser les erreurs et les dépendances avec des types d''erreur étiquetés et des interfaces de service Context.Tag","Composer avec Effect en utilisant pipe/Effect.gen","Appliquer les fondamentaux d''Effect TS au code et à l''architecture de l''utilisateur","Améliorer les compétences avec des effets et des erreurs dans Node, Bun et navigateur"],"de":["Kontext der Ausführung (Node, Bun, Browser) klären","Reine Domänenlogik von Effekten und Grenzen trennen","Fehler und Abhängigkeiten mit markierten Fehlertypen und Context.Tag-Service-Schnittstellen modellieren","Mit Effect komponieren, indem pipe/Effect.gen verwendet wird","Grundlagen von Effect TS auf Benutzercode und -architektur anwenden","Fähigkeiten mit Effekten und Fehlern in Node, Bun und Browser verbessern"],"pt":["Clarificação de contexto para runtime e goal","Separação de lógica de domínio puro e efeitos","Modelagem de erros e dependências com tagged error types","Composição com Effect usando pipe/Effect.gen","Aplicação de melhores práticas em código e arquitetura"],"ru":["Ясность контекста для runtime и goal","Разделение чистой域енной логики и эффектов","Моделирование ошибок и зависимостей с помощью tagged error types","Составление с Effect с помощью pipe/Effect.gen","Применение лучших практик в коде и архитектуре для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["توضيح السياق لزمن التشغيل والهدف","فصل المنطق النقي للمجال والآثار","نماذج الأخطاء والاعتماديات باستخدام أنواع الأخطاء المُ标َّة","التأليف مع Effect باستخدام pipe/Effect.gen","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات في الشفرة والهيكل لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use effect-ts-guide","effect-ts-guide setup guide","effect-ts-guide vs typescript","what is effect-ts-guide","effect-ts-guide install","effect-ts-guide alternative","effect-ts-guide best practices","effect-ts-guide for node developers","effect-ts-guide for browser runtime"],"zh":["Effect TS 教学","Effect-TS 基础","AIエージェント","用户代码优化","架构问题解决","runtime 的 clarify","pure domain logic","effects","tagged error types","Context.Tag 服务接口"],"ja":["Effect TS ガイド","Effect-TS の基礎","AIエージェント","ユーザーコードの最適化","アーキテクチャの問題解決","runtime の clarify","pure domain logic","effects","tagged error types","Context.Tag サービスインターフェイス"],"ko":["Effect TS 가이드","Effect-TS의 기본","AI 도구","사용자 코드 최적화","아키텍처 문제 해결","runtime의 clarify","pure domain logic","effects","tagged error types","Context.Tag 서비스 인터페이스"],"es":["Effect TS","Guía de Effect TS","Mejores prácticas de Effect TS","Desarrollo de software con Effect TS","Efectos y errores en Node","Efectos y errores en Bun","Efectos y errores en navegador","TypeScript","Herramientas de desarrollo de software","AI Agentes para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Effect TS","Guide d''Effect TS","Meilleures pratiques d''Effect TS","Développement de logiciels avec Effect TS","Effets et erreurs dans Node","Effets et erreurs dans Bun","Effets et erreurs dans navigateur","TypeScript","Outils de développement de logiciels","Agents IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["Effect TS","Effect TS-Leitfaden","Best Practices für Effect TS","Software-Entwicklung mit Effect TS","Effekte und Fehler in Node","Effekte und Fehler in Bun","Effekte und Fehler im Browser","TypeScript","Software-Entwicklungstools","KI-Agenten für Entwickler"],"pt":["Effect TS","Guia de Configuração","Melhores Práticas","Desenvolvimento de Software","Programação Funcional","TypeScript","Node JS","Bun","Browser"],"ru":["Effect TS","Руководство по Настройке","Лучшие Практики","Разработка Программного Обеспечения","Функциональное Программирование","TypeScript","Node JS","Bun","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Effect TS","دليل الإعداد","أفضل الممارسات","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة وظيفية","TypeScript","Node JS","Bun","متصفحات الويب","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ProverCoderAI","repo":"effect-template","repoPath":"ProverCoderAI/effect-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.379Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"effect-ts-guide","description":"Teach and apply Effect-TS practices (effect, @effect/schema, @effect/platform) for architecture, typed errors, Layers, dependency injection, resource safety, testing, and migration from async/await/Promise. Use when a user asks how to use Effect, requests best practices, wants to refactor to Effect, or needs mapping from platform modules to Node/Bun/Browser APIs.","bodyPreview":"# Effect TS Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this skill to teach Effect-TS fundamentals and best practices, then apply them to user code and architecture questions.\n\n## Teaching workflow\n\n1. Clarify context: runtime (node/bun/browser), goal (new app, refactor, review), and constraints.\n2. Separate core vs shell: identify pure domain logic vs effects and boundaries.\n3. Model errors and dependencies: define tagged error types and Context.Tag service interfaces.\n4. Compose with Effect: use pipe/Effect.gen,","body":"# Effect TS Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nUse this skill to teach Effect-TS fundamentals and best practices, then apply them to user code and architecture questions.\n\n## Teaching workflow\n\n1. Clarify context: runtime (node/bun/browser), goal (new app, refactor, review), and constraints.\n2. Separate core vs shell: identify pure domain logic vs effects and boundaries.\n3. Model errors and dependencies: define tagged error types and Context.Tag service interfaces.\n4. Compose with Effect: use pipe/Effect.gen, typed errors, and Layer provisioning.\n5. Validate inputs at boundaries with @effect/schema before entering core.\n6. Explain resource safety: acquireRelease, scoped lifetimes, and clean finalizers.\n7. Provide minimal, runnable examples tailored to the user context.\n8. If the user asks for version-specific or \"latest\" details, verify with official docs before answering.\n\n## Core practices (short list)\n\n- Use Effect for all side effects; keep core functions pure and total.\n- Avoid async/await, raw Promise chains, and try/catch in application logic.\n- Use Context.Tag + Layer for dependency injection and testability.\n- Use tagged error unions and Match.exhaustive for total handling.\n- Decode unknown at the boundary with @effect/schema; never leak unknown into core.\n- Use Effect.acquireRelease/Effect.scoped for resource safety.\n- Use @effect/platform services instead of host APIs (fetch, fs, child_process, etc.).\n\n## References\n\n- Read `references/best-practices.md` for the extended checklist and examples.\n- Read `references/platform-map.md` when comparing @effect/platform to Node/Bun/Browser APIs.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:05:30.401Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Node, Bun, or browser runtime Agents seeking to master Effect-TS fundamentals and best practices for robust application development.","zh":"适用于 Node、Bun 或浏览器运行时代理，旨在掌握 Effect-TS 基础知识和强大的应用程序开发最佳实践。","ja":"Node、Bun、またはブラウザランタイムエージェントがEffect-TSの基礎と強力なアプリケーション開発のベストプラクティスをマスターするのに適しています。","ko":"Node, Bun 또는 브라우저 런타임 에이전트가 Effect-TS의 기초와 강력한 애플리케이션 개발의 모범 사례를 마스터하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Node, Bun o tiempo de ejecución del navegador que buscan dominar los fundamentos de Effect-TS y las mejores prácticas para el desarrollo de aplicaciones robustas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Node, Bun ou exécution du navigateur cherchant à maîtriser les fondements de Effect-TS et les meilleures pratiques pour le développement d''applications robustes.","de":"Ideal für Node-, Bun- oder Browser-Laufzeit-Agents, die die Grundlagen von Effect-TS und die besten Praktiken für die Entwicklung robuster Anwendungen meistern möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agents Node, Bun ou tempo de execução do navegador que buscam dominar os fundamentos e as melhores práticas do Effect-TS para o desenvolvimento de aplicações robustas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Node, Bun или браузерной среды выполнения, стремящихся освоить основы и лучшие практики Effect-TS для разработки надежных приложений.","ar":"مثالية لموكل Node أو Bun أو وقت تشغيل المتصفح الذين يريدون إتقان أساسيات Effect-TS وأفضل الممارسات لتطوير تطبيقات قوية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply Effect-TS principles, separating core domain logic from effects and boundaries, and composing with Effect using pipe/Effect.gen for efficient error handling and dependency management across Node, Bun, and browser environments.","zh":"赋予代理应用 Effect-TS 原理，分离核心域逻辑和效果和边界，并使用管道/Effect.gen 组合 Effect 以实现 Node、Bun 和浏览器环境中的高效错误处理和依赖管理。","ja":"エージェントにEffect-TSの原則を適用し、コアドメインロジックと効果と境界を分離し、パイプ/Effect.genを使用してエフェクトを組み合わせ、Node、Bun、ブラウザ環境での効率的なエラーハンドリングと依存関係管理を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Effect-TS 원리를 적용하여 핵심 도메인 로직과 효과 및 경계를 분리하고, 파이프/Effect.gen을 사용하여 효과를 구성하여 Node, Bun 및 브라우저 환경에서 효율적인 오류 처리 및 의존성 관리를 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar los principios de Effect-TS, separando la lógica de dominio central de los efectos y límites, y componiendo con Effect utilizando pipe/Effect.gen para un control de errores y gestión de dependencias eficientes en entornos de Node, Bun y navegador.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les principes de Effect-TS, en séparant la logique de domaine central des effets et des limites, et en composant avec Effect en utilisant pipe/Effect.gen pour une gestion d''erreurs et une gestion de dépendances efficaces dans les environnements Node, Bun et navigateur.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Prinzipien von Effect-TS anzuwenden, indem sie die zentrale Domänenlogik von Effekten und Grenzen trennen und mit Effect unter Verwendung von pipe/Effect.gen für effizientes Fehlernmanagement und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung in Node-, Bun- und Browser-Umgebungen komponieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar os princípios do Effect-TS, separando a lógica de domínio central dos efeitos e limites, e compondo com o Effect usando pipe/Effect.gen para tratamento de erros eficiente e gerenciamento de dependências em ambientes Node, Bun e navegador.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять принципы Effect-TS, разделяя основную логiku домена от эффектов и границ, и составляя с Effect с помощью pipe/Effect.gen для эффективного xử lý ошибок и управления зависимостями в средах Node, Bun и браузера.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطبيق مبادئ Effect-TS، و فصل المنطق الأساسي للمجال عن الآثار والحدود، و التركيب باستخدام Effect باستخدام pipe/Effect.gen لتحديد أخطاء فعال و إدارة التبعيات عبر بيئات Node و Bun و المتصفح."},"useCases":{"en":["Architecting scalable applications with Effect-TS","Debugging complex Effect-TS pipelines","Refactoring existing codebases to leverage Effect-TS benefits"],"zh":["使用 Effect-TS 架构可扩展应用程序","调试复杂的 Effect-TS 流水线","重构现有的代码库以利用 Effect-TS 的优势"],"ja":["Effect-TSを使用してスケーラブルなアプリケーションを設計する","複雑なEffect-TSパイプラインのデバッグ","既存のコードベースをリファクタリングしてEffect-TSの利点を活用する"],"ko":["Effect-TS를 사용하여 확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 설계하는 것","복잡한 Effect-TS 파이프라인을 디버깅하는 것","기존 코드베이스를 리팩토링하여 Effect-TS의 이점을 활용하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones escalables con Effect-TS","Depurar tuberías complejas de Effect-TS","Reestructurar las bases de código existentes para aprovechar los beneficios de Effect-TS"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications scalables avec Effect-TS","Déboguer des pipelines complexes de Effect-TS","Réorganiser les bases de code existantes pour profiter des avantages de Effect-TS"],"de":["Skalierbare Anwendungen mit Effect-TS entwerfen","Komplexe Effect-TS-Pipelines debuggen","Bestehende Codebasen neu strukturieren, um die Vorteile von Effect-TS zu nutzen"],"pt":["Arquitetura de aplicações escaláveis com Effect-TS","Depuração de pipelines complexos do Effect-TS","Reestruturação de bases de código existentes para aproveitar os benefícios do Effect-TS"],"ru":["Проектирование масштабируемых приложений с Effect-TS","Отладка сложных конвейеров Effect-TS","Перестройка существующих кодовых баз для использования преимуществ Effect-TS"],"ar":["هندسة تطبيقات قابلة للتوسعة مع Effect-TS","تصحيح أخطاء أنابيب Effect-TS المعقدة","إعادة هيكلة قواعد الكود الحالية للاستفادة من فوائد Effect-TS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires familiarity with TypeScript and Effect-TS","Limited to Node, Bun, or browser runtime environments"],"zh":["需要熟悉 TypeScript 和 Effect-TS","仅限 Node、Bun 或浏览器运行时环境"],"ja":["TypeScriptとEffect-TSの知識が必要","Node、Bun、またはブラウザランタイム環境でのみ使用可能"],"ko":["TypeScript 및 Effect-TS에 대한 지식이 필요함","Node, Bun 또는 브라우저 런타임 환경에서만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere familiaridad con TypeScript y Effect-TS","Limitado a entornos de ejecución de Node, Bun o navegador"],"fr":["Requiert une connaissance de TypeScript et de Effect-TS","Limité aux environnements d''exécution Node, Bun ou navigateur"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von TypeScript und Effect-TS","Begrenzt auf Node-, Bun- oder Browser-Laufzeitumgebungen"],"pt":["Exige familiaridade com o TypeScript e o Effect-TS","Limitado a ambientes de tempo de execução do Node, Bun ou navegador"],"ru":["Требует знания TypeScript и Effect-TS","Ограничен средами выполнения Node, Bun или браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بالكود النصي TypeScript و Effect-TS","محدود بيئات تشغيل Node أو Bun أو المتصفح"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"dc167e79fdedd122cf9f17f06034f8be0130d397c06d465ec3c12fa556fbda07","qualityScore":29}');
