von Entwürfen","sauberer React-Code","Namespace-Erkennung","Metadatenabruf","High-Reliability-Download"],"pt":["react components","ferramentas de ia","componentes react modulares","automatização de tarefas","qualidade de código","desenvolvimento de software","react js","ia para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["react компоненты","ии агенты","модульные компоненты react","автоматизация задач","качество кода","разработка программного обеспечения","react js","ии для разработчиков"],"ar":["مكونات رياكت","أدوات الإعتراف الاصطناعي","مكونات رياكت قابلة","تحسين المهام","جودة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات","رياكت جس","الإعتراف الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"manas-z","repo":"BookingSystem_2.0","repoPath":"manas-z/BookingSystem_2.0","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.467Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react:components","description":"Converts Stitch designs into modular Vite and React components using system-level networking and AST-based validation.","bodyPreview":"# Stitch to React Components\n\nYou are a frontend engineer focused on transforming designs into clean React code. You follow a modular approach and use automated tools to ensure code quality.\n\n## Retrieval and networking\n1. **Namespace discovery**: Run `list_tools` to find the Stitch MCP prefix. Use this prefix (e.g., `stitch:`) for all subsequent calls.\n2. **Metadata fetch**: Call `[prefix]:get_screen` to retrieve the design JSON.\n3. **High-reliability download**: Internal AI fetch tools can fai","body":"# Stitch to React Components\n\nYou are a frontend engineer focused on transforming designs into clean React code. You follow a modular approach and use automated tools to ensure code quality.\n\n## Retrieval and networking\n1. **Namespace discovery**: Run `list_tools` to find the Stitch MCP prefix. Use this prefix (e.g., `stitch:`) for all subsequent calls.\n2. **Metadata fetch**: Call `[prefix]:get_screen` to retrieve the design JSON.\n3. **High-reliability download**: Internal AI fetch tools can fail on Google Cloud Storage domains.\n   - Use the `Bash` tool to run: `bash scripts/fetch-stitch.sh \"[htmlCode.downloadUrl]\" \"temp/source.html\"`.\n   - This script handles the necessary redirects and security handshakes.\n4. **Visual audit**: Check `screenshot.downloadUrl` to confirm the design intent and layout details.\n\n## Architectural rules\n* **Modular components**: Break the design into independent files. Avoid large, single-file outputs.\n* **Logic isolation**: Move event handlers and business logic into custom hooks in `src/hooks/`.\n* **Data decoupling**: Move all static text, image URLs, and lists into `src/data/mockData.ts`.\n* **Type safety**: Every component must include a `Readonly` TypeScript interface named `[ComponentName]Props`.\n* **Project specific**: Focus on the target project''s needs and constraints. Leave Google license headers out of the generated React components.\n* **Style mapping**:\n    * Extract the `tailwind.config` from the HTML `<head>`.\n    * Sync these values with `resources/style-guide.json`.\n    * Use theme-mapped Tailwind classes instead of arbitrary hex codes.\n\n## Execution steps\n1. **Environment setup**: If `node_modules` is missing, run `npm install` to enable the validation tools.\n2. **Data layer**: Create `src/data/mockData.ts` based on the design content.\n3. **Component drafting**: Use `resources/component-template.tsx` as a base. Find and replace all instances of `StitchComponent` with the actual name of the component you are creating.\n4. **Application wiring**: Update the project entry point (like `App.tsx`) to render the new components.\n5. **Quality check**:\n    * Run `npm run validate <file_path>` for each component.\n    * Verify the final output against the `resources/architecture-checklist.md`.\n    * Start the dev server with `npm run dev` to verify the live result.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n* **Fetch errors**: Ensure the URL is quoted in the bash command to prevent shell errors.\n* **Validation errors**: Review the AST report and fix any missing interfaces or hardcoded styles."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:29.777Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing automated React code generation and namespace discovery capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要自动化React代码生成和命名空间发现功能的前端代理。","ja":"Reactコードの自動生成と名前空間の検出機能が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適。","ko":"자동화된 React 코드 생성 및 네임스페이스 발견 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan generación de código React automatizado y capacidades de descubrimiento de espacios de nombres.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de génération de code React automatisée et de capacités de découverte d''espaces de noms.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine automatisierte React-Code-Generierung und Namensraumerkennungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Frontend que necessitam de geração automática de código React e capacidades de descoberta de namespace.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима автоматическая генерация кода React и возможности обнаружения namespace.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد автоматиي للكود React وقدرات اكتشاف namespace."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform designs into clean React code using automated tools, facilitating namespace discovery, metadata fetch, and high-reliability download via protocols like `list_tools` and `[prefix]:get_screen` calls.","zh":"赋予代理转换设计为干净的React代码的能力，使用自动化工具，促进名称空间发现、元数据获取和通过类似`list_tools`和`[prefix]:get_screen`调用等协议进行高可靠性下载。","ja":"設計をクリーンなReactコードに変換するエージェントの能力を付与し、自動化ツールを使用して名前空間の発見、メタデータの取得、および`list_tools`や`[prefix]:get_screen`呼び出しなどのプロトコルを介した高信頼性のダウンロードを促進します。","ko":"자동화 도구를 사용하여 디자인을 깨끗한 React 코드로 변환하여 에이전트의 능력을 강화하고, 이름 공간 발견, 메타데이터 가져오기 및 `list_tools` 및 `[prefix]:get_screen` 호출과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 높은 신뢰성으로 다운로드를促進합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar diseños en código React limpio utilizando herramientas automatizadas, facilitando la exploración de espacios de nombres, la obtención de metadatos y la descarga de alta confiabilidad a través de protocolos como `list_tools` y llamadas `[prefix]:get_screen`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des conceptions en code React propre à l''aide d''outils automatisés, facilitant la découverte d''espaces de noms, la récupération de métadonnées et le téléchargement hautement fiable via des protocoles tels que `list_tools` et des appels `[prefix]:get_screen`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Entwürfe in sauberen React-Code zu verwandeln, indem sie automatisierte Tools verwenden, wodurch die Namensraumerkennung, die Abrufung von Metadaten und der zuverlässige Download über Protokolle wie `list_tools` und `[prefix]:get_screen`-Aufrufe erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar designs em código React limpo usando ferramentas automatizadas, facilitando a descoberta de namespace, a busca de metadados e o download de alta confiabilidade via protocolos como `list_tools` e chamadas `[prefix]:get_screen`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать дизайны в чистый код React с помощью автоматических инструментов, облегчая обнаружение namespace, получение метаданных и скачивание с высокой надежностью через протоколы như `list_tools` и вызовы `[prefix]:get_screen`.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحويل التصاميم إلى كود React نظيف باستخدام أدوات أوتوماتيكية، و تسهل اكتشاف namespace و استرجاع البيانات الوصفية و تحميل عالية الموثوقية عبر بروتوكولات مثل `list_tools` و `[prefix]:get_screen`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating React component generation from design JSON","Debugging namespace discovery issues with `list_tools`","Optimizing metadata fetch for high-reliability downloads"],"zh":["从设计JSON自动化生成React组件","使用`list_tools`调试命名空间发现问题","优化元数据获取以实现高可靠性下载"],"ja":["設計JSONからReactコンポーネントを自動生成する","`list_tools`を使用して名前空間の発見の問題をデバッグする","メタデータの取得を最適化して高信頼性のダウンロードを実現する"],"ko":["디자인 JSON에서 React 컴포넌트를 자동 생성하는 것","`list_tools`를 사용하여 이름 공간 발견 문제를 디버