e modèles de composants serveur React invalides","Prise en charge de la structure de projet et des routes","Détection de composants client asynchrones invalides","Compatibilité avec les middleware et les proxy dans Next.js v16"],"de":["Dateikonventionen für Next.js-Projekte","Erkennung von ungültigen React-Server-Komponentenmustern","Unterstützung für Projektstruktur und Routen","Erkennung von ungültigen asynchronen Client-Komponenten","Kompatibilität mit Middleware und Proxy in Next.js v16"],"pt":["Convenções de arquivos para projetos Next.js","Limites de RSC para detectar padrões de componente inválidos","Suporte a rotas paralelas e interceptadoras","Renomeação de middleware em v16","Detecção de componentes de cliente assíncronos inválidos","Suporte a grupos de rotas"],"ru":["Файловые конвенции для проектов Next.js","Границы RSC для обнаружения недопустимых шаблонов компонентов","Поддержка параллельных и перехватывающих маршрутов","Переименование middleware в v16","Обнаружение недопустимых асинхронных компонентов клиента","Поддержка групп маршрутов"],"ar":["اتفاقيات الملفات لمشاريع next.js","حدود RSC لاكتشاف أنماط المكونات غير الصالحة","دعم المسارات الموازية والمتداخلة","إعادة تسمية middleware في v16","اكتشاف المكونات العميلة غير الصالحة异步","دعم مجموعات المسارات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use next-best-practices","next-best-practices setup guide","next-best-practices vs create-react-app","next-best-practices install","what is next-best-practices","next-best-practices alternative","next-best-practices tutorial","next-best-practices optimization","next-best-practices best practices"],"zh":["Next.js 项目最佳实践","文件约定","RSC 边界检测","路由优化","Middleware 重命名","异步客户端组件检测","Next.js 优化","React 服务器组件","路由配置"],"ja":["Next.js プロジェクトのベストプラクティス","ファイル規約","RSC境界検出","ルーティング最適化","ミドルウェアの名前変更","非同期クライアントコンポーネントの検出","Next.js 最適化","React サーバーコンポーネント","ルーティング設定"],"ko":["Next.js 프로젝트 최적화","파일 규칙","RSC 경계 검사","라우팅 최적화","미들웨어 이름 변경","비동기 클라이언트 컴포넌트 검출","Next.js 최적화","React 서버 컴포넌트","라우팅 설정"],"es":["mejores prácticas next.js","agente de ia para next.js","convenciones de archivos next.js","detección de patrones de componentes de servidor de react","next.js v16","middleware y proxy en next.js","desarrollo de aplicaciones web con next.js"],"fr":["meilleures pratiques next.js","outil ia pour next.js","conventions de fichiers next.js","détection de modèles de composants serveur react","next.js v16","middleware et proxy dans next.js","développement d''applications web avec next.js"],"de":["best practices next.js","ki-tool für next.js","dateikonventionen next.js","erkennung von react-server-komponentenmustern","next.js v16","middleware und proxy in next.js","webanwendungsentwicklung mit next.js"],"pt":["melhores práticas next.js","convenções de arquivos next.js","limites de rsc next.js","rotas paralelas next.js","middleware next.js","componentes de cliente assíncronos next.js","grupos de rotas next.js","configuração next.js","otimização next.js"],"ru":["лучшие практики next.js","файловые конвенции next.js","границы rsc next.js","параллельные маршруты next.js","middleware next.js","асинхронные компоненты клиента next.js","группы маршрутов next.js","настройка next.js","оптимизация next.js"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات ل next.js","اتفاقيات الملفات ل next.js","حدود rsc ل next.js","مسارات موازية ل next.js","middleware ل next.js","مكونات العميل异步 ل next.js","مجموعات المسارات ل next.js","إعداد next.js","تحسين next.js"]}},"owner":"ElementsAI-Dev","repo":"Cognia","repoPath":"ElementsAI-Dev/Cognia","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.518Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"next-best-practices","description":"Next.js best practices - file conventions, RSC boundaries, data patterns, async APIs, metadata, error handling, route handlers, image/font optimization, bundling","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\nApply these rules when writing or reviewing Next.js code.\n\n## File Conventions\n\nSee [file-conventions.md](./file-conventions.md) for:\n- Project structure and special files\n- Route segments (dynamic, catch-all, groups)\n- Parallel and intercepting routes\n- Middleware rename in v16 (middleware → proxy)\n\n## RSC Boundaries\n\nDetect invalid React Server Component patterns.\n\nSee [rsc-boundaries.md](./rsc-boundaries.md) for:\n- Async client component detection (invalid)\n- Non-ser","body":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\nApply these rules when writing or reviewing Next.js code.\n\n## File Conventions\n\nSee [file-conventions.md](./file-conventions.md) for:\n- Project structure and special files\n- Route segments (dynamic, catch-all, groups)\n- Parallel and intercepting routes\n- Middleware rename in v16 (middleware → proxy)\n\n## RSC Boundaries\n\nDetect invalid React Server Component patterns.\n\nSee [rsc-boundaries.md](./rsc-boundaries.md) for:\n- Async client component detection (invalid)\n- Non-serializable props detection\n- Server Action exceptions\n\n## Async Patterns\n\nNext.js 15+ async API changes.\n\nSee [async-patterns.md](./async-patterns.md) for:\n- Async `params` and `searchParams`\n- Async `cookies()` and `headers()`\n- Migration codemod\n\n## Runtime Selection\n\nSee [runtime-selection.md](./runtime-selection.md) for:\n- Default to Node.js runtime\n- When Edge runtime is appropriate\n\n## Directives\n\nSee [directives.md](./directives.md) for:\n- `''use client''`, `''use server''` (React)\n- `''use cache''` (Next.js)\n\n## Functions\n\nSee [functions.md](./functions.md) for:\n- Navigation hooks: `useRouter`, `usePathname`, `useSearchParams`, `useParams`\n- Server functions: `cookies`, `headers`, `draftMode`, `after`\n- Generate functions: `generateStaticParams`, `generateMetadata`\n\n## Error Handling\n\nSee [error-handling.md](./error-handling.md) for:\n- `error.tsx`, `global-error.tsx`, `not-found.tsx`\n- `redirect`, `permanentRedirect`, `notFound`\n- `forbidden`, `unauthorized` (auth errors)\n- `unstable_rethrow` for catch blocks\n\n## Data Patterns\n\nSee [data-patterns.md](./data-patterns.md) for:\n- Server Components vs Server Actions vs Route Handlers\n- Avoiding data waterfalls (`Promise.all`, Suspense, preload)\n- Client component data fetching\n\n## Route Handlers\n\nSee [route-handlers.md](./route-handlers.md) for:\n- `route.ts` basics\n- GET handler conflicts with `page.tsx`\n- Environment behavior (no React DOM)\n- When to use vs Server Actions\n\n## Metadata & OG Images\n\nSee [metadata.md](./metadata.md) for:\n- Static and dynamic metadata\n- `generateMetadata` function\n- OG image generation with `next/og`\n- File-based metadata conventions\n\n## Image Optimization\n\nSee [image.md](./image.md) for:\n- Always use `next/image` over `<img>`\n- Remote images configuration\n- Responsive `sizes` attribute\n- Blur placeholders\n- Priority loading for LCP\n\n## Font Optimization\n\nSee [font.md](./font.md) for:\n- `next/font` setup\n- Google Fonts, local fonts\n- Tailwind CSS integration\n- Preloading subsets\n\n## Bundling\n\nSee [bundling.md](./bundling.md) for:\n- Server-incompatible packages\n- CSS imports (not link tags)\n- Polyfills (already included)\n- ESM/CommonJS issues\n- Bundle analysis\n\n## Scripts\n\nSee [scripts.md](./scripts.md) for:\n- `next/script` vs native script tags\n- Inline scripts need `id`\n- Loading strategies\n- Google Analytics with `@next/third-parties`\n\n## Hydration Errors\n\nSee [hydration-error.md](./hydration-error.md) for:\n- Common causes (browser APIs, dates, invalid HTML)\n- Debugging with error overlay\n- Fixes for each cause\n\n## Suspense Boundaries\n\nSee [suspense-boundaries.md](./suspense-boundaries.md) for:\n- CSR bailout with `useSearchParams` and `usePathname`\n- Which hooks require Suspense boundaries\n\n## Parallel & Intercepting Routes\n\nSee [parallel-routes.md](./parallel-routes.md) for:\n- Modal patterns with `@slot` and `(.)` interceptors\n- `default.tsx` for fallbacks\n- Closing modals correctly with `router.back()`\n\n## Self-Hosting\n\nSee [self-hosting.md](./self-hosting.md) for:\n- `output: ''standalone''` for Docker\n- Cache handlers for multi-instance ISR\n- What works vs needs extra setup\n\n## Debug Tricks\n\nSee [debug-tricks.md](./debug-tricks.md) for:\n- MCP endpoint for AI-assisted debugging\n- Rebuild specific routes with `--debug-build-paths`\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:36.611Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Next.js Development Agents needing optimized code review and file convention management.","zh":"适合需要优化代码审查和文件约定管理的Next.js开发代理。","ja":"Next.js開発エージェントが最適化されたコードレビューとファイル命名規約管理を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"최적화된 코드 리뷰 및 파일 규약 관리가 필요한 Next.js 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Next.js que necesitan una revisión de código optimizada y una gestión de convenciones de archivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Next.js nécessitant une révision de code optimisée et une gestion de conventions de fichiers.","de":"Perfekt für Next.js-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte Code-Überprüfung und eine Dateikonventionsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do Next.js que precisam de revisão de código otimizada e gerenciamento de convenções de arquivo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Next.js, которым необходима оптимизированная проверка кода и управление соглашениями о файлах.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير Next.js الذي يحتاج إلى مراجعة رمز محسنة وإدارة اتفاقيات الملفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce best practices in Next.js projects, covering file conventions, route segments, and React Server Component boundaries, utilizing guidelines from files like ''file-conventions.md'' and ''rsc-boundaries.md''.","zh":"赋予代理人在Next.js项目中执行最佳实践的能力，涵盖文件命名规则、路由段和React Server Component边界，利用诸如''file-conventions.md''和''rsc-boundaries.md''文件中的指南。","ja":"エージェントがNext.jsプロジェクトでベストプラクティスを実施する能力を提供します。ファイル命名規則、ルートセグメント、React Server Componentの境界をカバーし、''file-conventions.md''や''rsc-boundaries.md''などのファイルからガイドラインを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Next.js 프로젝트에서 최선의 관행을 시행할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, 파일 규칙, 路由 세그먼트, React Server Component 경계를 다루고, ''file-conventions.md'' 및 ''rsc-boundaries.md''와 같은 파일의 가이드라인을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas en proyectos de Next.js, cubriendo convenciones de archivos, segmentos de rutas y límites de componentes del servidor de React, utilizando directrices de archivos como ''file-conventions.md'' y ''rsc-boundaries.md''.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques dans les projets Next.js, couvrant les conventions de fichiers, les segments de route et les limites des composants serveur React, en utilisant des directives issues de fichiers tels que ''file-conventions.md'' et ''rsc-boundaries.md''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, in Next.js-Projekten die besten Praktiken durchzusetzen, einschließlich Dateikonventionen, Routensegmenten und React-Serverkomponentengrenzen, unter Verwendung von Richtlinien aus Dateien wie ''file-conventions.md'' und ''rsc-boundaries.md''.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar as melhores práticas em projetos Next.js, abrangendo convenções de arquivo, segmentos de rota e limites de componentes do servidor React, utilizando diretrizes de arquivos como ''file-conventions.md'' e ''rsc-boundaries.md''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение лучших практик в проектах Next.js, охватывая соглашения о файлах, сегменты маршрутов и границы компонентов сервера React, используя руководящие принципы из файлов, таких как ''file-conventions.md'' и ''rsc-boundaries.md''.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض أفضل الممارسات في مشاريع Next.js، شاملة اتفاقيات الملفات وأقسام المسارات وحدود مكونات الخادم React، باستخدام الإرشادات من الملفات مثل ''file-conventions.md'' و ''rsc-boundaries.md''."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing consistent project structures and special files","Detecting invalid React Server Component patterns and async client components","Optimizing route configurations with dynamic, catch-all, and grouped routes"],"zh":["执行一致的项目结构和特殊文件","检测无效的React Server Component模式和异步客户端组件","优化路由配置，包括动态、catch-all和分组路由"],"ja":["一貫したプロジェクト構造と特別なファイルを実施する","有効でないReact Server Componentパターンと非同期クライアントコンポーネントを検出する","ルート構成を最適化し、動的、catch-all、グループ化されたルートを含む"],"ko":["일관된 프로젝트 구조 및 특수 파일 강제하기","유효하지 않은 React Server Component 패턴 및 비동기 클라이언트 구성 요소 감지하기","동적, catch-all 및 그룹화된 라우팅을 포함한 라우팅 구성 최적화"],"es":["Aplicar estructuras de proyecto y archivos especiales consistentes","Detección de patrones de componentes del servidor de React inválidos y componentes de cliente asíncronos","Optimización de configuraciones de rutas con rutas dinámicas, de captura y agrupadas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des structures de projet et des fichiers spéciaux cohérents","Détection de modèles de composants serveur React non valides et de composants client asynchrones","Optimisation des configurations de route avec des routes dynamiques, de capture et regroupées"],"de":["Durchsetzen konsistenter Projektstrukturen und spezieller Dateien","Erkennung ungültiger React-Serverkomponentenmuster und asynchroner Clientkomponenten","Optimierung von Routenkonfigurationen mit dynamischen, Catch-all- und gruppierten Routen"],"pt":["Aplicando estruturas de projeto consistentes e arquivos especiais","Detectando padrões de componente de servidor React inválidos e componentes de cliente assíncronos","Otimizando configurações de rota com rotas dinâmicas, de captura e agrupadas"],"ru":["Применение последовательных структур проекта и специальных файлов","Обнаружение недействительных шаблонов компонента сервера React и асинхронных клиентских компонентов","Оптимизация конфигураций маршрутов с динамическими, catch-all и сгруппированными маршрутами"],"ar":["تطبيق هياكل مشروع متسقة وملفات خاصة","كشف أنماط مكون الخادم React غير صالح وملحقات العميل غير المتزامنة","تحسين cấu подумات المسارات مع مسارات ديناميكية وشمولية ومجموعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js project setup","Limited to React Server Component patterns and Next.js file conventions"],"zh":["需要Next.js项目设置","仅限React Server Component模式和Next.js文件命名规则"],"ja":["Next.jsプロジェクトの設定が必要","React Server ComponentパターンとNext.jsファイル命名規則のみに限定される"],"ko":["Next.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요함","React Server Component 패턴 및 Next.js 파일 규칙만 해당"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto de Next.js","Limitado a patrones de componentes del servidor de React y convenciones de archivos de Next.js"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Next.js","Limité aux modèles de composants serveur React et aux conventions de fichiers Next.js"],"de":["Benötigt Next.js-Projektsetup","Begrenzt auf React-Serverkomponentenmuster und Next.js-Dateikonventionen"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto Next.js","Limitado a padrões de componente de servidor React e convenções de arquivo do Next.js"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Next.js","Ограничен шаблонами компонента сервера React и соглашениями о файлах Next.js"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Next.js","محدود بنماذج مكون الخادم React واتفاقيات الملفات Next.js"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c78f952d4e98bf3694856dbf70c03a6037d4e258ff3701f2642bfdf108549a25","qualityScore":29}');
