 or free-form Offers guidance on deciding between references and embedded content Supports planning for multi-channel content delivery Includes Sanity-specific implementation notes for content modeling content-modeling-best-practices is a set of principles for designing structured content that applies to any headless CMS, including Sanity');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('future3OOO/agentic-cockpit/cockpit-continuity-ledger', 'community', 'future3OOO', 'agentic-cockpit', 'future3OOO/agentic-cockpit', 'cockpit-continuity-ledger', 1, 0, 28, '2026-02-23T21:17:04Z', '2026-03-06T07:13:09.203Z', '558a2d9b3e353184731ff1670dfde18882020b87e0238799cc4ef7ab6a75fa45', '{"id":"future3OOO/agentic-cockpit/cockpit-continuity-ledger","name":"cockpit-continuity-ledger","description":{"en":"The cockpit-continuity-ledger skill helps developers maintain a compact source of truth for ongoing work. It provides a set of scripts to initialize, validate, and trim the continuity ledger.","zh":"Cockpit Continuity Ledger 是一个用于维护 `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` 文件的工具，提供初始化、验证和修剪功能","ja":"Cockpit Continuity Ledger は `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` ファイルを維持するためのツールで、初期化、検証、トリミング機能を提供する","ko":"Cockpit Continuity Ledger는 `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` 파일을 유지하기 위한 도구로 초기화, 검증 및 修剪 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Cockpit Continuity Ledger es una herramienta que ayuda a mantener un registro de trabajo continuo, con scripts de inicialización y validación. Utiliza Node.js y scripts de CLI para gestionar el registro","fr":"Cockpit Continuity Ledger est un outil qui aide à maintenir un registre de travail continu, avec des scripts d''initialisation et de validation. Il utilise Node.js et des scripts de CLI pour gérer le registre","de":"Cockpit Continuity Ledger ist ein Tool, das hilft, ein kontinuierliches Arbeitsprotokoll zu führen, mit Initialisierungs- und Validierungsskripten. Es verwendet Node.js und CLI-Skripte, um das Protokoll zu verwalten","pt":"O Cockpit Continuity Ledger é uma ferramenta para manter seu trabalho organizado, utilizando o arquivo `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` como fonte de verdade compacta","ru":"Cockpit Continuity Ledger - это инструмент для организации своей работы, использующий файл `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` в качестве компактного источ