INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('future3OOO/agentic-cockpit/cockpit-continuity-ledger', 'cockpit-continuity-ledger', 'future3OOO', 'agentic-cockpit', 'community', 'cockpit-continuity-ledger future3OOO agentic-cockpit community The cockpit-continuity-ledger skill helps developers maintain a compact source of truth for ongoing work. It provides a set of scripts to initialize, validate, and trim the continuity ledger. Cockpit Continuity Ledger 是一个用于维护 `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` 文件的工具，提供初始化、验证和修剪功能 Cockpit Continuity Ledger は `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` ファイルを維持するためのツールで、初期化、検証、トリミング機能を提供する Cockpit Continuity Ledger는 `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` 파일을 유지하기 위한 도구로 초기화, 검증 및 修剪 기능을 제공합니다 Cockpit Continuity Ledger es una herramienta que ayuda a mantener un registro de trabajo continuo, con scripts de inicialización y validación. Utiliza Node.js y scripts de CLI para gestionar el registro Cockpit Continuity Ledger est un outil qui aide à maintenir un registre de travail continu, avec des scripts d''initialisation et de validation. Il utilise Node.js et des scripts de CLI pour gérer le registre Cockpit Continuity Ledger ist ein Tool, das hilft, ein kontinuierliches Arbeitsprotokoll zu führen, mit Initialisierungs- und Validierungsskripten. Es verwendet Node.js und CLI-Skripte, um das Protokoll zu verwalten O Cockpit Continuity Ledger é uma ferramenta para manter seu trabalho organizado, utilizando o arquivo `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` como fonte de verdade compacta Cockpit Continuity Ledger - это инструмент для организации своей работы, использующий файл `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` в качестве компактного источника правды جدول استمرارية الطائرة هو أداة لتنظيم العمل، يستخدم ملف `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` كمصدر حقيقي مضغوط how to use cockpit-continuity-ledger cockpit-continuity-ledger setup guide what is cockpit-continuity-ledger cockpit-continuity-ledger alternative cockpit-continuity-ledger vs other ledger tools node scripts for continuity ledger cockpit-continuity-ledger install maintaining a compact source of truth Cockpit Continuity Ledger AIエージェント工具 代码连续性记录 初始化 验证 修剪 工作空间相对路径 Initializes the continuity ledger with `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs init` Validates the continuity ledger with `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs check` Trims the continuity ledger with `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs trim` Uses workspace-relative `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` paths for editing Maintains factual entries in the continuity ledger Cockpit-continuity-ledger is a skill that maintains a `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` file as the source of truth for ongoing work, using node scripts for initialization, validation, and trimming.');
