INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('narr07/kkgsoetomo/content-modeling-best-practices', 'content-modeling-best-practices', 'narr07', 'kkgsoetomo', 'community', 'content-modeling-best-practices narr07 kkgsoetomo community Content modeling best practices provide principles for designing flexible and maintainable structured content, applicable to headless CMS and including Sanity-specific implementation notes, benefiting developers and content creators. 内容建模最佳实践提供了设计灵活、可重用和可维护的结构化内容的原则，适用于任何头less CMS，包括Sanity コンテントモデリングベストプラクティスは、柔軟で再利用可能でメンテナンス性の高い構造化コンテンツを設計するための原則を提供する、ヘッドレスCMSに適応、Sanityを含む 컨텐츠 모델링 최적화 가이드는 유연하고 재사용 가능하며 유지 보수가 쉬운 구조화된 콘텐츠를 설계하는 원칙을 제공하는 데 도움을 준다, 헤드리스 CMS에 적합, Sanity 포함 Nuestras mejores prácticas de modelado de contenido ofrecen principios para diseñar contenido estructurado flexible, reusable y mantenible para herramientas de IA Nos meilleures pratiques de modélisation de contenu proposent des principes pour concevoir du contenu structuré flexible, réutilisable et maintenable pour les outils d''IA Unsere Best Practices für Content-Modellierung bieten Prinzipien für die Gestaltung von strukturiertem Inhalt, der flexibel, wiederverwendbar und wartbar ist, für KI-Tools As melhores práticas de modelagem de conteúdo para headless CMS, incluindo conceitos de Sanity, para criar conteúdo flexível e reutilizável Лучшие практики моделирования контента для headless CMS, включая концепции Sanity, для создания гибкого и повторно используемого контента أفضل الممارسات لتحسين نموذج المحتوى ل headless CMS, بما في ذلك مفاهيم Sanity, لإنشاء محتوى مرن و قابل لإعادة الاستخدام how to use content modeling best practices what is content modeling best practices content modeling best practices for headless CMS Sanity content modeling best practices content modeling best practices setup guide content modeling best practices tutorial headless CMS content modeling structured content design principles content modeling best practices for AI agents 内容建模 结构化内容 头less CMS Sanity 多渠道内容分发 内容模型设计 AIエージェント 内容最佳实践 Provides guidelines for starting new projects and designing content models Offers principles for evaluating structured vs free-form content Includes Sanity-specific implementation notes for content modeling Supports planning for multi-channel content delivery Enables refactoring of existing content models for better maintainability Content-modeling-best-practices is a set of principles for designing structured content that''s flexible, reusable, and maintainable, applicable to any headless CMS');
